2. **Java**: Widely used in industry, with a strong emphasis on object-oriented programming.

```java
class Node {
    int data;
    Node next;

    Node(int data) {
        this.data = data;
        this.next = null;
    }
}

public class LinkedList {
    Node head;

    public LinkedList() {
        this.head = null;
    }
}
```

3. **C++**: Offers fine-grained control over system resources and memory management.

```cpp
struct Node {
    int data;
    Node* next;

    Node(int data) : data(data), next(nullptr) {}
};

class LinkedList {
public:
    Node* head;

    LinkedList() : head(nullptr) {}
};
```

